{"v":3,"catch":"戰鬥的時刻已然來臨！挺身而起吧，真正的英雄！","desc":"《BATTLANTIS》是KONAMI於1987年推出的射擊遊戲。\n玩家目標是捍衛城堡免遭怪物軍團入侵，必須在敵軍攀越城牆前全數擊潰。\n唯有年輕的Cripeuss三世國王能拯救神聖的Battlantis島嶼。挺身而出，驅逐邪惡怪物吧！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-10-09","genres":["街機","射擊"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"輔12歳級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/babb7011272ebc195cc9813a1a37752fda18dc0d046babaf8117c7b25ae9514a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d8cb08e186651cd5390ee9f77e65a560f2245168a11774d25230f9f5b37ff272.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0aac7e8dcbab65afc83e87fbf8de520fee278fb4c49f2ebd2ecd2c992c166b1c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0f2ed336869a50982bcee88f8b23a941711ed08399aef14e4c44cb8d7c004cda.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5038d1bd2126d009e25034ce76dff5cccf0e9dacf7d1cd90801a976c5c4a8c69.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0a6a19fcbfc4c109291991dfce1bc4197315e6c210dbc1e208de6e85b737a86d.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f5f024c2c000","dlc":[]}